---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionImageText from '../../components/SectionImageText.astro';

const title = "Surviving High Season Traffic on the Riviera | ECOFUNDRIVE";
const description = "Beat the summer traffic on the French Riviera. Insider tips for avoiding jams, best travel times, and why a private driver changes everything.";
const keywords = [
  'French Riviera traffic',
  'Côte d\'Azur summer traffic',
  'avoid traffic Nice Cannes',
  'best time travel Riviera',
  'private driver beat traffic'
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  currentPage="guide-high-season-traffic-french-riviera"
  canonical="/en/guide-high-season-traffic-french-riviera"
  lang="en"
  keywords={keywords}
  breadcrumbItems={[
    { name: "Home", url: "/en" },
    { name: "Guides", url: "/en/guides" },
    { name: "Traffic Guide", url: "/en/guide-high-season-traffic-french-riviera" }
  ]}
  schema={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": title,
    "description": description,
    "image": "https://www.ecofundrive.com/assets/img/hero/hero-aeroport-nice.webp",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "ECOFUNDRIVE" },
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "ECOFUNDRIVE",
      "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://www.ecofundrive.com/assets/img/logo/logo.png" }
    },
    "datePublished": "2024-03-01",
    "dateModified": new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]
  }}
>
  <main class="page-content">
    <div class="container py-lg">
      <h1 class="text-center mb-xl">Beating the Riviera: Traffic Survival Guide</h1>
      <p class="lead text-center mb-xl">
        July and August on the French Riviera are magical – but so is the traffic. Millions of visitors arrive, and the roads weren't designed for them. Here's how to keep your vacation stress-free.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- THE REALITY -->
    <SectionImageText
      title="The Reality: What to Expect"
      image="/assets/img/hero/hero-aeroport-nice.webp"
      alt="Riviera traffic"
      imageSide="right"
      ctaText="Skip the Traffic"
      ctaLink="/en/booking"
    >
      <p>
        <strong>The A8 Motorway</strong> (Nice-Cannes-Monaco) becomes a parking lot from 10 AM to 7 PM in July-August. A normally 30-minute Nice to Cannes drive can take 90 minutes.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Coastal Roads</strong> are even worse: the N98 to Saint-Tropez is legendarily awful (4-hour waits not unheard of), and Monaco is accessible only with local knowledge.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Parking?</strong> Good luck. Beach parking can cost €30-50/day – if you find a space at all.
      </p>
    </SectionImageText>

    <!-- GOLDEN HOURS -->
    <section class="mb-xl container">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-lg">The Golden Hours: When to Travel</h2>
      <div class="grid-3-cols">
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">🌅 Early Morning (Before 9 AM)</h3>
          <p>The roads are quiet, parking spaces exist, and beaches are empty. Arrive at your destination by 9:30 AM and you'll feel like you have the Riviera to yourself.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">🌙 Evening (After 7 PM)</h3>
          <p>Beach traffic has cleared, day-trippers have gone home. Perfect time for a scenic drive, dinner reservation, or late sunset transfer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">⛱️ Midday (Avoid!)</h3>
          <p>11 AM – 4 PM is the absolute worst. Everyone is going to or from the beach. If you must travel now, have a professional driver who knows alternatives.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECRET ROUTES -->
    <SectionImageText
      title="Secret Routes: What Your GPS Won't Tell You"
      image="/assets/img/guides/villages-perches.webp"
      alt="Back roads Riviera"
      imageSide="left"
      ctaText="Book Local Expert"
      ctaLink="/en/booking"
    >
      <p>
        <strong>Our drivers know the alternatives:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>To Monaco:</strong> Via La Turbie and the Grande Corniche – often faster and always more beautiful than the jammed A8.</li>
        <li><strong>To Saint-Tropez:</strong> Through La Garde-Freinet and Grimaud back roads, avoiding the infamous D98 bottleneck.</li>
        <li><strong>Nice to Cannes:</strong> Through the hilltop villages of Vence and Grasse when the A8 is jammed.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These routes aren't just faster – they're an experience in themselves, through Provence's most beautiful landscapes.</p>
    </SectionImageText>

    <!-- WHY PRIVATE DRIVER -->
    <section class="mb-xl container">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-lg">Why a Private Driver Changes Everything</h2>
      <div class="grid-2-cols">
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">😌 Zero Stress</h3>
          <p>Traffic becomes someone else's problem. You can read, nap, answer emails, or simply gaze at the Mediterranean views. Arrive relaxed, not frustrated.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">🅿️ No Parking Nightmares</h3>
          <p>Your driver drops you at the door and finds parking elsewhere – or waits nearby. When you're ready, they're there. No hiking from distant car parks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">🍷 Drink Freely</h3>
          <p>Rosé with lunch? Champagne at sunset? No designated driver needed. Enjoy the Riviera lifestyle fully.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content bg-light p-4 rounded">
          <h3 class="mb-3">📍 Local Knowledge</h3>
          <p>Your driver knows which beach club is hot right now, which restaurant has availability, and which viewpoint has the best sunset photos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA FINAL -->
    <section class="mb-xl container">
      <div class="text-center bg-light p-5 rounded">
        <h2 class="mb-4">Skip the Traffic, Start Your Vacation</h2>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
          Whether it's an airport transfer or a full day of exploring, let us handle the roads.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
          <a href="/en/booking" class="btn btn-primary">Book Your Driver</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/33616552811" class="btn btn-outline">WhatsApp Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
